    "turn_idx": 56,
    "turn_text": "Just so our listeners know, that was shortly after. I mean, that was like two years after the Republicans had retaken control of the House for the first time in 40 years. Right. So this would not be necessarily a time when you'd think a liberal progressive Democrat from Massachusetts would get much",
