    "turn_idx": 96,
    "turn_text": "let me just tell you this. As somebody who has Celiac sprue and I was diagnosed back in 1998 before it was even a thing. Doctors do need to know a lot more about the relation between food and medicine because I'm allergic to a lot of medicine because it uses products that have gluten. I mean, it sounds silly, but I would have doctors prescribing things for me that I was allergic to.",
