    "turn_idx": 101,
    "turn_text": "See, these are the things that a lot of people don't hear about because the news world is so focused on what did we treat this day? What did she say that day? The back and forth with all these big issues, but really Congress is made up of 535 members who are trying to accomplish what might not be massive bits of legislation, but ideas that can turn into big deals",
