  {
    "episode_id": 50996,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50996.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 119,
    "turn_text": "one of my favorite people that I work with for many years on this was Joanne Emerson, who I love in a door. Yeah. And she, you know, was, was an incredible ally. That's when the Republicans were in control because she would always help me sneak things into things. So I really, you know, I will ever be grateful to her for that.",
