    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50996.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 133,
    "turn_text": "Right, but here's the deal. We all ran for office to help the people that we now represent. I mean, why would I want to delegate that ability to help my people to somebody else, to a bureaucracy? And I love all the people who work in our agencies, but the bottom line is, I know what will work in my district and what won't work in my district, and where some money might create additional state matches and private matches and we could actually build something and I've got a zillion examples here to point out where it has worked and so so I hope I hope we get to bring it back.",
