    "turn_idx": 134,
    "turn_text": "Okay now let me just transition to your role as the Chairman of the Rules Committee. A lot of people out there don't understand why does the House need a rules committee? What is a rules committee? And so like in a nutshell, tell people why your job is so important, why you're sort of the gatekeeper as to what goes on on the floor.",
