    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50996.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 182,
    "turn_text": "Especially since Congress deals with a lot of heady issues, and sometimes things are just so not great, so bad that all you can do is kind of laugh, just, you know, you have to break it up a little bit, and we're human.",
